# Altium design files.
#
# This repo is a TOOL, not a board. It should never contain real design data -
# this project sits near a working Altium environment, so one careless
# `git add -A` is all it takes to publish a customer's board to a public repo.
# The agent's own DelphiScript (*.PrjScr, *.pas, *.dfm) is deliberately NOT
# ignored; actual design documents are.
*.PcbDoc
*.SchDoc
*.PrjPcb
*.PrjPcbStructure
*.SchLib
*.PcbLib
*.IntLib
*.DbLib
*.OutJob
*.BomDoc
*.Harness
*.PCBDwf
*.pdnaK
*.Drc
*.Net
*.Nsx

# Altium scratch
History/
__Previews/
Project Logs for */
Project Outputs for */
*.bak
~$*

